msgid "{actor} updated an emoji"
msgstr "{actor} עדכן אימוג'י"

#. Activity log summary when settings of an announcement channel were changed. The changes are listed as detail rows below it. {actor} is the member who made the change, shown as a clickable user chip, or the word System. {channel} is the channel, shown as a channel chip with its name.
#: src/features/guild/utils/guild_tabs/audit_log/AuditLogChannelMessages.ts
msgid "{actor} updated the announcement channel {channel}"
msgstr "{actor} עדכן את ערוץ ההכרזות {channel}"

#. Activity log summary when settings of a channel category were changed. The changes are listed as detail rows below it. {actor} is the member who made the change, shown as a clickable user chip, or the word System. {channel} is the category, shown as a channel chip with its name.
#: src/features/guild/utils/guild_tabs/audit_log/AuditLogChannelMessages.ts
msgid "{actor} updated the category {channel}"
msgstr "{actor} עדכן את הקטגוריה {channel}"

#. Activity log summary when settings of a channel of a type this app version cannot name were changed. The changes are listed as detail rows below it. {actor} is the member who made the change, shown as a clickable user chip, or the word System. {channel} is the channel, shown as a channel chip with its name.
